        "summary": "User Lucas Brown (lucas_brown_4047) wants to change the date of reservation EUJUY6 by moving it out 2 days due to his wife's tragic passing. However, the reservation contains flights that have already been flown (ORD-DEN and DEN-LAS on 2024-05-14, which was yesterday). According to policy, if any portion of the flight has already been flown, the agent cannot help and transfer is needed. User is extremely distraught but insists on changing the date rather than cancelling."
